    "text": "<p>Aqua regia is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>Cl</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>(i)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Au</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>Cl</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>AuCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mover><msub><mi>HAuCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p>(ii)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pt</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>Cl</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>PtCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>PtCl</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></p>",
